{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d6306a2fde6c040975493831a3733d64c18cb335d41a537fd0e4ea63503de886", "ja": "（千鶴さんを追いかけ回していた記者たちは、\nある日を境に、姿を見せなくなった。その理由は……）", "zh": "（那些一直追着千鹤小姐不放的记者，从某一天开始就再也没有露面了。理由是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "9aafc16d4488d43923bb7e01ab46bda7553d3a4115d3f30aa0829ee2dfaa2f14", "ja": "千鶴さん、なに読んでるの？", "zh": "千鹤姐姐，你在看什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "75a9a8a9186c7d1c66f382d0add786b786f8f2b42722b53742aed3291ff85731", "ja": "芸能雑誌ですわ。わたくしを追いかけていた方々の\n告発記事が載っていますのよ。", "zh": "是演艺杂志呢。上面刊登了那些追着我跑的人们的揭发报道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "c3e776417ea93ad248f0f92b34585fd2a89e734017b8200c33ef70da0b6c5d26", "ja": "わぁ、すごい！　あの記者さんたちも、\n雑誌デビューしたんだね！", "zh": "哇，好厉害！那些记者也登上杂志出道了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "fe6291f10ad189c6cf2120b58e4504f54fc411563a9bf6997740eb8bc8cad420", "ja": "こくはつって、なんて書いてあるの？", "zh": "“こくはつ”是怎么写的呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "a7a6f862aa76ae27c4ae43a89b9d411b456465c4e777798452f8146c213532ef", "ja": "『過激な取材の数々！\n悪質なパパラッチ集団を告発！』だそうですわ。", "zh": "据说写的是“多次进行过激采访！\n揭发恶劣的狗仔团伙！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9007c66d14a0ee3a2bf367b5d65a1add8d07111afb29f300e3e76d63b3ec2d96", "ja": "どうやら千鶴さんだけじゃなくて、他の芸能人も\nしつこく追いかけ回されてたみたいだな。", "zh": "看来不只是千鹤，其他艺人似乎也一直被纠缠着跟拍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "43bf6ec1d4820805a38138835cdac5918095f6886deb892f7fbf9007140474e3", "ja": "ミキも他の事務所のコに相談されたぐらいなの。\n告発されてトーゼンってカンジ！", "zh": "美希也被其他事务所的女孩找来商量过呢。被揭发也是理所当然的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "f6018f818b6000cba22a5b36a7ab1e9253e174785cec7cd7cf2aca4a75ae473b", "ja": "そうなんだ～。それじゃ、\nしばらくは静かにしてもらえそうですね！", "zh": "原来如此～。这样一来，暂时应该能让她们安分一阵子了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1009_p", "source_sha256": "526fdcdf89636e45ff0993d34d29da8d1faf206e1d7741433de0192d6b64e549", "ja": "そうだな。ネットでもこの記事が話題になってる\nみたいだし、世間的にも風当たりが強くなってるから。", "zh": "是啊。网上好像也在热议这篇报道，社会舆论对他们也越来越不利了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1010_p", "source_sha256": "33da3e8282de731c0c49e0b083082c9d7ba906475cb8bf67cbbfc1fb079c3874", "ja": "あ、そうだ。\n手を回してくれた社長にお礼を……。", "zh": "啊，对了。\n得向帮忙打点的社长道谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "114be0a430d7b723c2230137cf0ebd0ca69eec010ac1c60810c84a862c68315e", "ja": "え？\n社長にお礼？", "zh": "咦？\n向社长道谢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
