{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_144_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "90500601f6d8936d9e3e4f402b0d5451d38f80d6c1ff80dd1dd1e26994c15e95", "ja": "……はい、ひとまずは、これで！", "zh": "……是的，暂时算是告一段落了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
